--- task
id: r08
dataset: reading
kind: count per destination
answer: fewest

--- intent
For each document that is cited at least once, how many documents cite it? Return the slug and the count as `cited_by`.

--- edition2
query citation_counts() {
  match { $d: Doc  $o cites $d }
  return { $d.slug, count($o) as cited_by }
}

--- edition3
query citation_counts() {
  match { $d: Doc  $o cites $d }
  return { $d.slug, count($o) as cited_by }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["d.slug","cited_by"]
["d0",1]
["d3",2]
["d4",1]
